      "text": "\n$8.03$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For isothermal process $(\\Delta T=0)$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Delta S & =R \\ell \\mathrm{n} \\frac{P_1}{P_2}=8.314 \\ell \\mathrm{n} 2 \\\\\n& =8.314 \\times 0.693=5.76 \\mathrm{JK}^{-1} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
